   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Dutch Orchestra Blues**: back after 62 archived shows (1186 days) [4]\n- **If You See Light**: rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- **Stars Fell On Alabama**: back after 109 archived shows (1889 days); rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Nine Black Poppies**: back after 32 archived shows (426 days) [4]\n- **Cheshire County**: back after 59 archived shows (1166 days) [4]\n- **Lakeside View**: back after 116 archived shows (1922 days); rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2023-02-15.SBD.AUD.Matrix** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 22 songs; 93 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **tmg2023-02-15**: source not stated; 22 songs; 0 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- John borrowed an audience member's phone to read lyrics during the song [1]\n- The performance included two false starts before the song began properly [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2023-02-15.SBD.AUD.Matrix**: taped by docrupard; source: SBD/AUD Matrix [1]. Also: Soundboard TASCAM DR-40 and audience Roland R07 matrixed in Adobe Audition [1]\n- **tmg2023-02-15**: taped by GrayJedi [2]",
